        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVLYO19, Lyon Black Glass Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Black Glass Lyon Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate has classic beauty with a modern twist, thanks to the Black Lyon Glass Knob. The Fifth Avenue Tall Plate has the elegance you'd expect for something named after the famed city street, its rectangular shape manages to look traditional and modern at the same time. The Lyon Black Glass Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is available in dummy, passage and privacy functions; and will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Black Glass Lyon Knob is wonderfully complimented by all the finish colors available for the Fifth Avenue Plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Lyon Knob with Fifth Avenue Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Black Lyon Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Glass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.11\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVLYO19-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262364\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVLYO19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
