                "title": "Black Glass Lyon Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate",
                "description": "The Black Glass Lyon Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate has classic beauty with a modern twist, thanks to the Black Lyon Glass Knob. The Fifth Avenue Tall Plate has the elegance you'd expect for something named after the famed city street, its rectangular shape manages to look traditional and modern at the same time. The Lyon Black Glass Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate is available in dummy, passage and privacy functions; and will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Black Glass Lyon Knob is wonderfully complimented by all the finish colors available for the Fifth Avenue Plate.",
